From e213b4c94403b40f4b3adf7609701a5c19ce9805 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:24:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] guest: authorize encrypted workspaces through measured policy

Bind disk and key selection to measured workspace policy. Use CDH to open
existing encrypted devices and the measured initializer for authorized
first use. Extend guest mount ownership to mapper, readonly-device and
initializer resources so failures unwind in dependency order.

Validate active LUKS2 parameters and enforce readonly before exposing the
workspace. Host metadata never supplies its encryption authorization.

Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
